Subject: [PATCH] Add Supabase database types; bump vue-tsc to v3

Without app/types/database.types.ts the Supabase client falls back to
Database = unknown and every table is typed as never.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WPvKoe9XoPDb9BDDJ8ya4Q
